{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Sheeple_Features_Gif.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Neko_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Procedural Map Generation -</strong> each time you join an online game or start a new campaign, brand new maps are created so that your experience is always unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Pink_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Deckbuilding -</strong> Summon Undead, create a Black Hole, or drop a Nuke, use your best cards to achieve victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Shiny_Sheep_Market.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Army Building -</strong> choose from various units ranging from rats up to High-tech pandas to build an undefeatable army. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Poison_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Interactable Maps -</strong> throw your enemies into holes, hit explosive barrels, or trigger wasp hives to annihilate your enemies!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Descriptions_Purple.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Necro_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Solo Campaign</strong>, play alone in the campaign mode to conquer the world and regain the original sheep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Ily_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Online Multiplayer - J</strong>oin an online multiplayer match to fight and defeat other Sheeple (no limit on player count)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Christmass_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Infinite Local Multiplayer - </strong>Split your screen as many times as you want! There is a recommended number, but I won't stop you from testing your PC! Play battles with as many friends as you want! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Golden_Sheep_Market.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Online Local Multiplaye</strong>r - Join online games with your local players. You can take your friends on split screen into an online lobby!\u00a0 <u>[No limit on local player count]</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div>And so much more!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Blue_Descriptions_Scaled.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Green_Description_Gifs.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Descriptions_Green_English.png?t=1753195641\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921480?t=1753195641","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2921480?t=1753195641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/aec70cd9f5feecd09f267577524c2b1e395941f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753195641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/aec70cd9f5feecd09f267577524c2b1e395941f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753195641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3552670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Sheeple_Features_Gif.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Neko_Sheep_idle.gif?t=1753195641\" /></div><strong>Procedural Map Generation -</strong> each time you join an online game or start a new campaign, brand new maps are created so that your experience is always unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921480/extras/Pink_Sheep_idle.gif?t=17531